1. **Import Module:**
```javascript
const { Application } = require('/application.js');
```
2. **Query Version & Identity:**
```javascript
console.log('App:', Application.productFullName);
console.log('Build:', Application.version);
```
3. **Inspect Active Documents Collection:**
```javascript
const doc = Application.documents.current;
console.log('Active Doc:', doc ? doc.title : 'No doc open');
```
4. **Execute:** Run the code. Notice the instant return in ~100ms with full version telemetry!
